  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetsf&#xf6;rmedling i Vitryssland, fas 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Employment Services in Belarus, Phase 2 - Public Employment Services in Belarus phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet bygger p&#xe5; en pilot genomf&#xf6;rd i Minsk 2009-2011 och syftar till att i samverkan med vitryska arbetsf&#xf6;rmedlingar (PES) och med    expertis fr&#xe5;n Arbetsf&#xf6;rmedlingen f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra prognoser om behov p&#xe5; arbetsmarknaden, &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen till information och tj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r     arbetss&#xf6;kande, inkl utsatta grupper, samt f&#xf6;r arbetsgivare, inklusive privata sektorn med fokus p&#xe5; SMEs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds upon a pilot conducted in Minsk during 2009-2011 and aims to, through collaboration with Belarusian Public Employment  Services (PES) and expertise from the Swedish Public Employment       Services improve models for prognoses on needs on the labour market, increased acccess to information and services for jobseekers, including vulnerable groups, and employers, with focus on private SMEs</narrative>
  </description>
